  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span><span><span>该材质包提供两种外观选项：标准版与连接版。</span></span></span></strong></span></em></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<h3><strong><span><span><span>材质美化来源参考：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cozyui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">CozyUI+</span></a>。请搭配对应的材质包使用。<br></span></span></span></strong></h3>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h3><strong><span><span><span>版本：<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">neoforge 1.21.x<span style=\"color:#fff\">，</span></span>其他版本请自行测试并反馈结果。<br></span></span></span></strong></h3>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h3><strong><span><span><span>本材质包遵循 GPL-3.0 许可证。如需源文件请联系我。</span></span></span></strong></h3>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span><span><span>模组：<span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><a style=\"color:#fbeeb8\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks</a></span></span></span></span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span><span><span>推荐搭配使用的</span></span></span></strong><strong>资源包<span><span><span>：<span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><a style=\"color:#c2e0f4\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cozyui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CozyUI+</a></span></span></span></span></strong></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong><span><span><span>本材质包基于：<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://github.com/Fogg05/CozyUI-Plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CozyUI-plus</a></span></span></span></span></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
